/**
 * Manage a process with the default shutdown hooks.
 *
 * @return an Object with functions corresponding to the different shutdown handlers, 
 *         sigInt, sigQuit, sigTerm, uncaughtException and unhandledRejection. During 
 *         shutdown trigger, this object is used as a jump table, so the object can be 
 *         used to either disable triggers or replace them as needed.
 */
