/**
 * Registry that contains information about the current timeouts from
 * dcpSetTimeout. Each object is removed from the array after the
 * timeout has completed.
 *
 * This takes the form of an array of objects where each object has
 * four properties:
 *   delay                MS before callback is executed
 *   initialTime          MS Unix time dcpSetInterval was called
 *   initalTimePlusDelay  MS Unix time callback can be executed
 *   callback             The callback function to be execuetd
 */
